# ⚡ Tropsi X Kernel

**Custom Non-GKI Kernel for the OnePlus kona platform**

![Kernel](https://img.shields.io/badge/KERNEL-4.19.325--cip132-blue?style=for-the-badge) ![Root](https://img.shields.io/badge/ROOT-ReSukiSU-orange?style=for-the-badge) ![SUSFS](https://img.shields.io/badge/SUSFS-v2.2.0-success?style=for-the-badge) ![Base](https://img.shields.io/badge/BASE-ppajda%20XTD-critical?style=for-the-badge)

[Telegram](https://t.me/TropsiXKernel) · [Releases](https://github.com/TropsPk/Tropsi_X_Kernel/releases) · [Issues](https://github.com/TropsPk/Tropsi_X_Kernel/issues)

</div>

---

> [!WARNING]
> Flashing a custom kernel carries risk of instability, bootloops, or other issues. You flash at your own risk — the maintainer is not responsible for any damage to your device.

---

## 📱 Supported Devices

| Device | Codename |
|:---|:---|
| OnePlus 8 | `instantnoodle` |
| OnePlus 8 Pro | `instantnoodlep` |
| OnePlus 8T | `kebab` |
| OnePlus 9R | `lemonades` |

---

## 🧩 Build Info

| Component | Details |
|:---|:---|
| Kernel | Linux 4.19.325-cip132 |
| Root Solution | ReSukiSU |
| SUSFS | v2.2.0 |
| Toolchain | Neutron Clang 19.0.0 + Neutron LLD |
| Base | ppajda's XTD kernel |
| Branch | `sm8250_t_13.1_op8` |

---

## ✨ Why Tropsi X

- Buttery smooth day-to-day performance
- ReSukiSU + SUSFS v2.2.0 root, hidden clean
- Full LLVM build — no GCC in the chain

---

## 🚀 Flashing

1. Grab the latest build from [Releases](https://github.com/TropsPk/Tropsi_X_Kernel/releases)
2. Flash via custom recovery (AnyKernel3 zip), or `fastboot boot` to test first
3. Reboot

